{
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "root": "data/warm/fmp/",
  "doctrine": [
    "Every FMP /stable family that is NOT a bulk file (justhodl-fmp-bank owns bulk + eod-bulk) is banked here, verbatim JSON (gz), under data/warm/fmp/<dataset>/...",
    "Endpoint names and parameters come from the fmp_data 2.8.0 SDK catalog (262 /stable endpoints, 2026-08) - never guessed; a refusal is recorded by http code in the catalog, never worked around.",
    "kinds: list (unparameterized, every run), latest_pages (paged newest-first feed, pages until overlap with the last pull), daily_dated (date= param, one file per day, backfill from floor), window (from/to month windows, backfill from floor), per_entity (one file per symbol/cik/exchange/..., rotation by cursor), per_entity_period (one file per entity per fiscal quarter, periods from a dates endpoint or a trailing range).",
    "Universes: tierA = US-listed, actively trading equities + US ETFs (full per-symbol coverage, rotation measured and published); all = every symbol FMP lists (bulk-covered families already hold them; per-symbol families reach them on the slower lap); chart = the chart's banked US names + core 40 (1-minute bars).",
    "Derived families are not pulled twice: technical indicators (computed from banked bars), statement TTM endpoints (derivable from banked quarters), company-outlook (a composite of banked endpoints), custom DCF (parametric), stock-price-change (derivable from EOD), financial-reports-json/xlsx (duplicates the SEC bulk XBRL lane). Listed in skipped[] so the coverage card can say so.",
    "Big paged reference feeds (cik-list, shares-float-all, all-industry-classification, delisted-companies, latest-financial-statements) are banked one object per page under <id>/<date>/pNNN - nothing merged in memory (v1.1.0, after the first live run died without a state write)."
  ],
  "universes": {
    "all": {
      "from": "stock-list",
      "field": "symbol",
      "union": [
        "etf-list"
      ]
    },
    "tierA": {
      "from": "stock-list",
      "field": "symbol",
      "filter": "us_active",
      "union": [
        "etf-list:us"
      ]
    },
    "etfs_us": {
      "from": "etf-list",
      "field": "symbol",
      "filter": "us"
    },
    "chart": {
      "from": "chart-universe"
    },
    "transcript_symbols": {
      "from": "earnings-transcript-list",
      "field": "symbol",
      "filter": "tierA"
    },
    "holder_ciks": {
      "from": "institutional-ownership/latest",
      "field": "cik",
      "accumulate": true
    },
    "senate_ids": {
      "from": "senate-profile",
      "field": "senateId",
      "alt_fields": [
        "bioguideId",
        "id"
      ]
    },
    "exchanges": {
      "from": "available-exchanges",
      "field": "exchange",
      "alt_fields": [
        "name"
      ]
    },
    "sectors": {
      "from": "available-sectors",
      "field": "sector"
    },
    "industries": {
      "from": "available-industries",
      "field": "industry"
    },
    "cot_symbols": {
      "from": "commitment-of-traders-list",
      "field": "symbol",
      "alt_fields": [
        "tradingSymbol"
      ]
    },
    "commodities": {
      "from": "commodities-list",
      "field": "symbol"
    },
    "forex": {
      "from": "forex-list",
      "field": "symbol"
    },
    "cryptos": {
      "from": "cryptocurrency-list",
      "field": "symbol"
    },
    "indexes": {
